WEBVTT

00:25:30.007 --> 00:25:33.364
and they make possible the next discovery.

00:25:33.388 --> 00:25:37.038
But, I mean -- the 1960s, Minnesota ...
Where did that come from?

00:25:37.062 --> 00:25:39.255
EG: ... spinster in love
with her married boss,

00:25:39.279 --> 00:25:42.437
the guy missing in the jungle ...

00:25:42.461 --> 00:25:46.594
I'm very comfortable --
I have a lot of comfort with mystery.

00:25:46.618 --> 00:25:49.171
I don't need to understand
where that came from.

00:25:49.195 --> 00:25:53.025
I've got a big warehouse in my mind
where I store stuff that makes no sense,

00:25:53.049 --> 00:25:54.952
and I'm very comfortable in that world.

00:25:54.976 --> 00:25:56.224
So it doesn't agitate me.

00:25:56.248 --> 00:25:58.637
It just makes me want to play more.

00:25:58.661 --> 00:26:02.798
It just makes me want
to love this world more.